"%@\n当前经 DERP 中继。perf 默认拒绝经中继测速；自建中继可勾选“允许经 DERP”，Tailscale 公共中继始终拒绝。" = "%@\nThe connection is relayed through DERP. perf blocks relayed tests by default. Enable Allow DERP for a private relay; public Tailscale relays remain blocked.";
